  "adaptations": [
    "Core workspace name/type/Node24 and exact MongoDB dependency; root lock remains authoritative.",
    "Legacy HTTP client is not instantiated or allowed to read remote credentials in bootstrap; remote dashboard explains core connection.",
    "Safe standalone exporter with exact file manifest and runtime-only lock, no ref or development dependencies.",
    "Node-only tests ported; browser sections run separately; authored API/adapter/package/paths tests use temporary state.",
    "README/setup/env examples updated, sample scenarios replaced with public fixtures, optional startup task renamed to avoid legacy task collision.",
    "WFI-03 (2026-11-12): engine 0.2.0 adds opt-in integrated mode, pinned local policy, grant/watchdog, persistent fencing/barriers and confirmed quiescence. Extension 4.3.0 reports settlementVersion=1 and settled receipts. Standalone v1 remains explicit legacy behavior.",
    "WFI-04 (2026-11-12): engine 0.3.0 lifecycleVersion=1, exclusive runtime mutex, owned IPC lifecycle and drain/unknown health; core runner attach/managed supervisor uses fixed daemon entrypoint and filters child environment.",
    "WFI-05 (2026-11-12): engine 0.4.0 profile/grant API and foreground serialization; extension 4.4.0 versioned bind, worker nonce, configurable loopback port and debugger ownership proof; real unpacked MV3 E2E in isolated Chromium profile. Original upstream hashes remain unchanged."
  ]
